&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As a part of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The Brandtech Group&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, we&#39;re at the forefront of leveraging cutting-edge AI technology to revolutionise how we create and deliver work. Our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;AI solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; enhance efficiency, spark creativity, and drive insightful decision-making, empowering our teams to produce innovative and impactful results.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Role: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;Design Director (part time - 2.5 days a week)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Location: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW15286838 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW15286838 BCX8&quot;&gt;London/Hybrid with &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW15286838 BCX8&quot;&gt;occasional travel to Birmingham&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW15286838 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About the role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As Design Director, you&#39;ll serve as both brand guardian and strategic creative partner for Client — leading the studio&#39;s creative output while building close relationships with senior stakeholders across marketing, communications, and the partnership. This is a director-level role with genuine scope: you&#39;ll set the creative vision, maintain brand consistency across all channels, and develop the talent around you. You&#39;ll work closely with OLIVER&#39;s creative leadership, bringing your expertise to everything from campaign concepting and typographic craft to team coaching and executive presentations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you will be doing:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead all visual communications for Client, acting as brand guardian across print, digital, social, and events — ensuring consistency, quality, and strategic alignment at every touchpoint&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the creative vision and direction for the studio, translating complex briefs from senior stakeholders into compelling, sophisticated design solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, mentor, and develop the in-house creative team — providing clear creative direction, constructive feedback, and ongoing coaching that elevates individual craft and collective output&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary creative partner to senior Client stakeholders, including marketing leadership and firm partners, presenting creative strategy and executions with confidence and clarity at executive level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the production of high-quality communications tailored for professional services audiences — from thought leadership campaigns and pitches to events and digital content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion and evolve Client&#39;s brand system, keeping it contemporary, distinctive, and appropriate for a regulated sector environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage multiple concurrent projects across the portfolio, balancing hands-on creative contribution with leadership responsibilities and proactive problem-solving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with OLIVER&#39;s wider creative and account leadership to identify opportunities to grow the studio&#39;s offering and deepen the Client relationship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee studio-level production budgets — including cost estimation, supplier relationships, and spend reporting — ensuring financial performance aligns with Client and OLIVER expectations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive responsible integration of AI tools across studio workflows, setting quality standards and governance that preserve craft excellence while improving efficiency&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you need to be great in this role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong portfolio of sophisticated brand and campaign work, with particular depth in B2B, corporate, or professional services environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert-level understanding of brand systems — how to build, maintain, and evolve them within complex, regulated contexts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of leading and developing creative teams, with a coaching approach that brings out the best in people at all levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience presenting creative work to executive and partner-level audiences, with the presence and communication skills to hold a room and advocate for ideas with conviction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep craft knowledge across print and digital — typography, layout, art direction, and visual storytelling — with the ability to contribute hands-on when the work demands it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Adobe Creative Suite (Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign) and familiarity with Figma and contemporary design tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing studio-level or project-level production budgets, including supplier relationships and cost oversight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating AI tools strategically across studio projects and operations, with the ability to set quality standards and governance at studio level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear understanding of where AI enhances creative output — and where human craft and judgement remain essential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drives thoughtful AI adoption within the team, maintaining rigorous human oversight and mentoring others in responsible, effective use&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agentic approach to complex creative and business challenges: systematic, adaptive, and focused on outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
